            "heading": "",
            "text": "<h3><strong>Spacious toe box<\/strong><\/h3><h4>Because feet aren’t pointed<\/h4><p><\/p><p>Have you ever noticed? Feet aren’t pointed — so why are shoes? In a pointed toe, the toes are cramped and can’t do their work.<\/p><p>That’s why we make <strong>Ahinsa shoes with a spacious toe box<\/strong>. They free your toes and fit you the first time you put them on. That comfort!<\/p>",
