    "feature_columns_rKrJQT": {
      "type": "feature_columns",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block_ErGETU": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/krouzek_produkt_na_LP_yuva_c671f3a1-b06d-425b-ba06-538d9b5ba485.jpg",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>My Ahinsa shoes are more than comfortable — I don’t wear anything else. Before I started wearing Ahinsa shoes, my feet always hurt at night. Now that my feet have room, the pain is gone.<\/p><p><strong>Lilith<\/strong> – Yuva Comfort sneakers<\/p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_link": "_blank",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "fade"
          }
        },
        "text_block_knaMdn": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/krouzek_produkt_na_LP_chitra.png",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>I’ve never had such comfortable shoes. The moment I slipped into them I knew I didn’t want any others! I walk very well in them, naturally, without having to think about it.<\/p><p><strong>Janina<\/strong> – Chitra Trek&Trail<\/p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_link": "_blank",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "fade"
          }
        },
        "text_block_wgBJpU": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/krouzek_produkt_na_LP_vida.png",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>Incredibly comfortable, wonderful shoes that instantly became my favourites. I’ve never worn anything better. They not only look great, they’re also light as a feather and as comfortable as slippers. <\/p><p><strong>Monika<\/strong> – Vida Comfort<\/p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_link": "_blank",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "fade"
          }
        },
        "text_block_3Ekif4": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/krouzek_produkt_na_LP_bindu.png",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>After five months of wearing my Bindu casual shoes almost every day I can happily say they’re the most comfortable shoes I’ve ever had. Like walking in slippers.<\/p><p><strong>Gabriela<\/strong> – Bindu 2 Comfort<\/p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_link": "_blank",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "fade"
          }
        },
        "text_block_UHKEB3": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/krouzek_produkt_na_LP_hiker.png",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>Walking in your shoes is like walking on a cloud. I feel really good in them. I walk about 5 km almost every day. I even took them on a longer walk in the Šumava mountains — we covered 12 km and my problems with pressure spots on my toes didn’t appear at all. Thank you for the easy-going trips.<\/p><p><strong>Jana<\/strong> – Hiker Comfort<\/p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_link": "_blank",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "fade"
          }
        }
      },
